WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.721
EXTRACT and DATE_TRUNC solve different problems
EXTRACT

00:00:05.747 --> 00:00:11.379
month gives a number such as three DATE_TRUNC month
gives a full

00:00:11.405 --> 00:00:17.000
month bucket such as March first twenty twenty-six
at midnight If

00:00:17.026 --> 00:00:24.664
you group only by month number March from multiple
years can be combined accidentally DATE_TRUNC

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:28.335
often gives a safer full-period key for time-series
aggregation
